id: GO-SEC-023
title: Template injection risk
category: security
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .go
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ _test.go
patterns:
  - regex: template\.(HTML|JS|URL|CSS)\(
    message: "Explicit template type assertion — verify input is sanitized"
  - regex: template\.New\(.*\.Parse\(.*(fmt\.Sprintf|\+)
    message: "Dynamic template construction — risk of template injection"
fix: Use static template files. Never construct templates from user input.
